      "feedback": "自动测试：36/49。\n用例 h06-13，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 CompletionLight, MotorForward, MotorReverse, firingTemp, kick。\n用例 h06-26，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 CompletionLight, MotorForward, MotorReverse, firingTemp, kick。\n用例 h06-27，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 CompletionLight, MotorForward, MotorReverse, firingTemp, kick。\n用例 h06-28，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 CompletionLight, MotorForward, MotorReverse, firingTemp, kick。\n用例 h06-29，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 CompletionLight, MotorForward, MotorReverse, firingTemp, kick。\n用例 h06-30，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 CompletionLight, MotorForward, MotorReverse, firingTemp, kick。\nLTL 检查：not_run。\nObserved execution (no expected values or test notes):\n{\"failed_case\": \"h06-13\", \"mode\": \"sequence\", \"prefix_omitted\": true, \"input_trace\": [{\"case\": \"h06-2\", \"inputs\": {\"ForwardButton\": true}, \"const_inputs\": {}, \"initial_interface_values\": {}, \"cycles\": 1, \"scan_interval_ms\": null}, {\"case\": \"h06-3\", \"inputs\": {\"ReverseButton\": true}, \"const_inputs\": {}, \"initial_interface_values\": {}, \"cycles\": 1, \"scan_interval_ms\": null}, {\"case\": \"h06-4\", \"inputs\": {\"ForwardButton\": true, \"ReverseButton\": true}, \"const_inputs\": {}, \"initial_interface_values\": {}, \"cycles\": 1, \"scan_interval_ms\": null}, {\"case\": \"h06-5\", \"inputs\": {\"Mode\": true, \"SensorFeed\": true}, \"const_inputs\": {}, \"initial_interface_values\": {}, \"cycles\": 1, \"scan_interval_ms\": null}, {\"case\": \"h06-6\", \"inputs\": {\"Mode\": true}, \"const_inputs\": {}, \"initial_interface_values\": {}, \"cycles\": 1, \"scan_interval_ms\": null}, {\"case\": \"h06-7\", \"inputs\": {\"Mode\": true, \"SensorWash\": true}, \"const_inputs\": {}, \"initial_interface_values\": {}, \"cycles\": 1, \"scan_interval_ms\": null}, {\"case\": \"h06-8\", \"inputs\": {\"Mode\": true, \"SensorWash\": true, \"washComplete\": true}, \"const_inputs\": {}, \"initial_interface_values\": {}, \"cycles\": 1, \"scan_interval_ms\": null}, {\"case\": \"h0